{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Backrooms Lost Runners</strong> is a cooperative survival-horror experience that challenges you and your friends to confront your deepest fears. Every environment is fraught with danger, mystery, and unexpected twists. Only through seamless teamwork and careful attention to detail can you survive and unravel the secrets of the Backrooms.   <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072120/extras/eb0cf85c943a0a4c8123d800d7c7d398.avif?t=1768582721\" width=616 height=198 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Atmosphere</strong><br>Venture through dimly lit corridors with dynamic lighting and realistic sound design. In this world, every footstep\u2014and every whisper\u2014could be your last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging Logic Puzzles</strong><br>Engage with a variety of puzzles built around electrical circuits, switches, and ciphers. Each challenge is adapted to your team\u2019s approach and demands inventive problem-solving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072120/extras/2e4fa5377f719beb2f4c6d6a419caa1d.poster.avif?t=1768582721\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072120/extras/2e4fa5377f719beb2f4c6d6a419caa1d.webm?t=1768582721\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072120/extras/2e4fa5377f719beb2f4c6d6a419caa1d.mp4?t=1768582721\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adaptive Threats</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face unique entities that react to sound, light, and movement. Some monsters home in on your voice; others lurk silently in the dark. Learn their behavior to stay one step ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072120/extras/98b2a50f17c407297b718c5c2377957a.poster.avif?t=1768582721\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072120/extras/98b2a50f17c407297b718c5c2377957a.webm?t=1768582721\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072120/extras/98b2a50f17c407297b718c5c2377957a.mp4?t=1768582721\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sanity Mechanics</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monitor your mental state: staying near heat sources or in the source of light slows sanity loss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tesseract Afterlife</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death is just the beginning. Upon death, you find yourself in a surreal Tesseract realm where your only goal is to return to life. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072120/extras/697341d2ff2b49f9d7dae0092f0042d7.poster.avif?t=1768582721\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072120/extras/697341d2ff2b49f9d7dae0092f0042d7.webm?t=1768582721\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072120/extras/697341d2ff2b49f9d7dae0092f0042d7.mp4?t=1768582721\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>True Cooperative Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collaboration is crucial for survival. Manage your resources, coordinate tactics via voice chat, and make collective choices. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072120/extras/8f24afd3d2101e51d89e5b0884e85a65.avif?t=1768582721\" width=616 height=198 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><strong>Storyline &amp; Quest System</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discovering scattered journals, audio logs, and flash drives you piece together the catastrophe\u2019s timeline.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072120/extras/7cc03faca2b7fa3e7890bb2bd9d0bff9.poster.avif?t=1768582721\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072120/extras/7cc03faca2b7fa3e7890bb2bd9d0bff9.webm?t=1768582721\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072120/extras/7cc03faca2b7fa3e7890bb2bd9d0bff9.mp4?t=1768582721\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072120/extras/d13f5e05bc8d0c269d6ff54dbb20c287.poster.avif?t=1768582721\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072120/extras/d13f5e05bc8d0c269d6ff54dbb20c287.webm?t=1768582721\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072120/extras/d13f5e05bc8d0c269d6ff54dbb20c287.mp4?t=1768582721\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Resource Management &amp; Character Progression</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scavenge for food, clothing, and tools to maintain health, stamina, and sanity. Will you risk venturing alone for high-value loot, or stick close to your squad?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find valuable items and resources by exploring camps, lockers, and shelters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072120/extras/a0657f96a9e8e7f9f2cc533532034118.poster.avif?t=1768582721\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072120/extras/a0657f96a9e8e7f9f2cc533532034118.webm?t=1768582721\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072120/extras/a0657f96a9e8e7f9f2cc533532034118.mp4?t=1768582721\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reality-Bending Anomalies</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beware zero-gravity zones, sudden teleportation gates, and shifting walls. In the Backrooms, the laws of physics are against you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072120/extras/fbc59e4b979bfa989b7c8e94f2f66f62.poster.avif?t=1768582721\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072120/extras/fbc59e4b979bfa989b7c8e94f2f66f62.webm?t=1768582721\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072120/extras/fbc59e4b979bfa989b7c8e94f2f66f62.mp4?t=1768582721\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>YOUR ADVENTURE IS JUST BEGINNING.</u></strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072120/extras/98e65517cdbc52a9132218eaca46db67.avif?t=1768582721\" width=616 height=198 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Add to your wishlist \u2013 here`s why!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Backrooms Lost Runners blends heart-pounding horror, brain-teasing puzzles, and rich cooperative gameplay into a continuously evolving adventure. With new maps, creatures, crafting, base-building, and additional mechanics on the way, adding the game to your wishlist lets you track updates.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3072120?t=1768582721","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3072120?t=1768582721","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072120/eab43f7b4e1fa8ac10aab5d743192258bc71fa23/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768582721","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072120/eab43f7b4e1fa8ac10aab5d743192258bc71fa23/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768582721","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3971460,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Backrooms Lost Runners</strong> is a cooperative survival-horror experience that challenges you and your friends to confront your deepest fears. Every environment is fraught with danger, mystery, and unexpected twists. Only through seamless teamwork and care